# 🎓 CEDT Intern Position Finder

Web scraping + data analysis app for finding internship positions.  
**Run:** `streamlit run main.py`

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
git clone https://github.com/supakornPanya/Scraping_Intern.git
cd Scraping_Intern
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## 📖 Usage (3 Tabs)

| Tab | Purpose | Output |
|-----|---------|--------|
| **1️⃣ Search** | Scrape via Paginated/Detail API | CSV files |
| **2️⃣ Visualize** | Merge CSVs, view stats & charts | Merged data + insights |
| **3️⃣ Bookmark** | Filter & auto-bookmark positions | bookmark_log.csv |

## 📡 API Endpoints

```
GET  /api/sessions/5/openings?page={p}&limit=20    (Paginated)
GET  /api/sessions/5/openings/{id}                 (Detail)
POST /api/sessions/5/openings/{id}/bookmark        (Bookmark)
```

## 📁 Project Structure

```
├── main.py                 # Streamlit app
├── .env                    # Cookie
├── Helper/
│   ├── scraping_Paginated.py
│   ├── scraping_Detail.py
│   ├── Visualize.py
│   └── bookmark.py
└── logs/                   # app.log, error.log
```

## 💡 Quick Workflows

**Find Best Positions:**
```
1. Tab 1 → Scrape pages 1-16
2. Tab 2 → Merge CSV → View stats
3. Tab 3 → Filter: 250-400฿, ratio<2, Hybrid
4. Tab 3 → Bookmark All
```

**Compare Data Sources:**
```
1. Tab 1 → Scrape paginated API
2. Tab 1 → Scrape detail API (different IDs)
3. Tab 2 → Select both CSVs → Merge
```

## 🛠️ Troubleshooting

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| Cookie error | Update `.env` with fresh token from login |
| No CSV files | Run scraping in Tab 1 first |
| Slow scraping | Reduce page/ID range |

## 📊 Key Features

✅ Scrape 300+ positions | ✅ Auto-merge & deduplicate | ✅ Statistical analysis  
✅ Interactive filters | ✅ One-click bookmarking | ✅ Progress tracking

